    Use YAML for workflows everywhere (#6798)
    
    Fixes #6720.
    
    It seems to me that most of us prefer the YAML format for workflows over
    the XML format. Yet we are still using the XML format almost everywhere.
    This PR aims at changing that, by converting all our workflows in
    `etc/workflows` to YAML and also fixing up the docs.
    
    As this only aims at converting from one format to another, this should
    result in no functional changes.
    
    This PR also includes the script I used to help me with converting. It
    is not supposed to be a perfect migration script, but I thought it may
    still be useful to adopters who have yet to switch to the YAML format. I
    have no qualms about removing it though.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Best way to test this will probably be to run all the workflows.
    
